i thing its bug, coz i need edit config file for working in "Kimi For Coding". It seems like I should either remove this provider from the list in OpenCode or replace User-Agent with Kimi KLI by default. Because without manually adding it to the configuration, it simply won't work. Here's what I added to the configuration to get it working without limits again:
```
"kimi-for-coding": {
  "models": {
    "k2p6": {
      "headers": {
        "User-Agent": "KimiCLI/1.5"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
